Available when compiled with libbfio support:
.nf
.Ft int
.Fo libluksde_volume_open_file_io_handle
.Fa "libluksde_volume_t *volume"
.Fa "libbfio_handle_t *file_io_handle"
.Fa "int access_flags"
.Fa "libluksde_error_t **error"
.Fc
.fi
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Fn libluksde_get_version
function is used to retrieve the library version.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
Most of the functions return NULL or \-1 on error, dependent on the return \
type.
For the actual return values see
.In libluksde.h .
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
None
.Sh FILES
None
.Sh NOTES
libluksde can be compiled with wide character support (wchar_t).
.sp
To compile libluksde with wide character support use:
.Ar ./configure --enable-wide-character-type
 or define:
.Ar _UNICODE
 or
.Ar UNICODE
 during compilation.
.sp
.Ar LIBLUKSDE_WIDE_CHARACTER_TYPE
 in libluksde/features.h can be used to determine if libluksde was compiled with wide character support.
